   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The preposition «am» with dates and days",
     "texto": [
      "To fix a day or date on the German calendar, there are precise rules:",
      "1. **Days of the week and times of day:**",
      "**am Montag**, **am Dienstag**, **am Wochenende**.",
      "2. **Full dates (am + declined ordinal number):**",
      "The ordinal number takes the ending **-ten** after «am» (or **-sten** from number 20):",
      "**am ersten Mai** (the first of May).",
      "**am zweiten Oktober** (the second of October).",
      "**am dritten Dezember** (the third of December).",
      "**am zwanzigsten Juli** (the twentieth of July).",
      "3. **Contrast of time prepositions:**",
      "**um** → exact times: **um acht Uhr**, **um halb neun**.",
      "**am** → days and dates: **am Montag**, **am dritten Mai**.",
      "**im** → months and seasons: **im Mai**, **im Sommer**, **im Winter**."
     ],
